!!! oculus/session/integration.mat
!!! Integration layer — wires compositor, input, and window manager together.
!!!
!!! This module handles the cross-cutting concerns: when a window is
!!! created, the compositor needs to know; when input arrives, the
!!! window manager needs to route it; when a theme changes, the
!!! compositor needs to recompose.

